  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MWAHR - Equal opportunities for diverse societies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Within the Kvinnna till Kvinna Foundation&apos;s regional programme &quot;Democracy and Resilience in the Western Balkans: Supporting Feminist Change Agents&quot; the partner organisation Mitrovica Women Association for Human Rights (MWAHR) is implementing the 12 month project &quot;Equal opportunities for diverse societies&quot;.The project consists of two main objectives; Promotion of Feminism and Strengthening of Feminist/Human Rights Defender Groups from the Mitrovica region, and Integration of Women from Roma, Ashkali, Egyptian, and Other Vulnerable Groups.</narrative>
  </description>
